# Make it testable

A testable question names something you can change or observe. Narrow a broad idea into a small comparison with a clear outcome.

## A simple example

Instead of asking for the best design, ask which of two shapes spans a fixed gap with less deflection under the same load.

**Useful relationship:** total trials = designs × repeats

## Pause and try

Write a question you can investigate in one short session.

